      "text": "**Turn text into speech and recordings into text.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-voice) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-voice) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-voice)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-voice/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
