      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Edge speech requires a network connection; ASR needs your own service configuration.\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-voice/blob/master/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
